# --- notes ---
# DB_*: DigitalOcean managed MySQL. The server's IP must be added to the
#   database's Trusted Sources in the DO panel or connections time out.
# PD_UPLOAD_SECRET: must equal the web server's value, and this machine's IP
#   must be in PD_UPLOAD_IP_ALLOWLIST in the web server's .env.
# SOCKET_SERVER_*: legacy live-progress socket; nothing connects to it.
#   Keep HOST=127.0.0.1 PORT=5000 USE_SSL=false.
